            <ArticleTitle>[Thrombophilia as a clinical problem].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>392-406</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The term thrombophilia has not yet been clearly defined. Starting from clinical observations, attempts were made to give a definition which may indicate the direction of further clinico-experimental studies. The known causes for thrombophilic states were discussed from the clinical point of view. Possibilities for diagnosis and treatment of thrombophilic states were reported.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
